SUMMARY:Language Café
LOCATION:Moncus Park\, 2913 Johnston St\, Lafayette
DESCRIPTION:Step into something global right here in Lafayette! Language Ca
 fé is a dynamic monthly gathering where language\, culture\, and communit
 y come together in an energetic\, welcoming atmosphere. Practice conversat
 ional phrases\, discover new traditions\, and connect with neighbors from 
 diverse backgrounds\, all in the heart of Moncus Park. Each month highligh
 ts a different culture\, with international students and local cultural or
 ganizations helping host the experience. Expect authentic conversations\, 
 cultural insights\, and opportunities to learn directly from those who liv
 e and share these traditions every day. Location: Treehouse Deck Fall 2026
  Dates: September 17 - Hispanic Heritage Month: Spanish language and tradi
 tions October 15 - Filipino American Heritage Month: Filipino Fiesta Novem
 ber 19 - Native American Heritage Month: Native languages Whether you are 
 brushing up on a second language\, curious about the world\, or simply loo
 king to meet new people\, Language Café is a relaxed and engaging space t
 o expand your perspective and build meaningful connections. Come learn. Co
 me explore. Come connect. 🌍✨\n\nhttps://moncuspark.org/calendar-event
